# Arrows Play release record: versionCode 25 (versionName 1.0.0), local bundleRelease from tag release/vc25 (no EAS).
# status: candidate
# Owner 2026-11-20: "in store we only have 22 ... bundle all into 1 with latest changes". Replaces the vc23 and vc24
# candidates (never uploaded). Everything in vc24 (Buddy Santa icon, the "Hop" splash, Buddy menu logo, stats chip, intro-
# deferred consent/AdMob/ambience) plus two flags ON over the vc22 set:
# - META_SEASON_SPLASH: the splash dresses for Valentine's (1-14 Feb), spring (Mar-May) and summer (Jun-Aug) by the
#   phone's date; outside those windows it is the winter splash exactly as vc24.
# - META_UPDATE_PROMPT: when Google Play reports a newer version, a Buddy "New version ready" card on the menu (at most
#   once per 3 days per version); Update runs Play's flexible download, then an "Update ready" chip installs it.
#   Play-install only; verified on a sideloaded build with Play's FakeAppUpdateManager, not yet from a Play install.
# QA flags (QA_DATE, QA_*_SWITCH, QA_SPLASH_*, QA_UPDATE_FAKE) and CAPTURE_DIAG are unset: no QA chips, real clock, real Play.
# Shell use: set -a; . release/vc25.env; set +a
# Checked by src/__tests__/releaseRecord.test.ts. History: never edit a shipped record; add vc<N>.env.
# consent: EXPO_PUBLIC_CONSENT_GATE=1. Google UMP runs before AdMob starts and fails closed: no ad until UMP resolves, none after a refusal. Needs the AdMob GDPR message published first, or EEA players get no ads.
